## What to build

Implement /ralph-commands from codebase exploration to a user-approved, saved, verified .ralph/commands.json. Execute setup, checks, app startup/readiness, and cleanup through a platform-aware runner. Expose clear setup status in OpenCode and block project readiness when verification fails. Preserve previous verified configuration until a replacement is explicitly approved.

